{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>לך</b> — Rabbi Moses said: לך means 'for your sake,' like אמרי לי אחי הוא ('my brother says to me'). The meaning is: I say that which you commanded us through your messengers, and you said to us, 'Seek My face'; therefore, Your face, YHWH, do I seek."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:42.438300203Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}